    "notes": "Two sessions at Van Gelder Studio, Englewood Cliffs. March 7, 1963 (tracks 3, 6): Mobley/Byrd/Hancock/Warren/Jones. October 2, 1963 (tracks 1-2, 4-5 + both alternate takes): Mobley/Morgan/Hill/Ore/Jones. Material from the March session also appears on The Turnaround! (1965). Bonus tracks 7-8 are CD-era alternate takes, flagged accordingly. AllMusic's 'Jo Jones' drum credit is treated as a page error \u2014 every discographic source gives Philly Joe Jones."
